## {{if .EnvKeys}}5{{else}}3{{end}}. Database

Run `goose up`.
{{- if .Redis}}

Redis holds sessions, codes, attempts and TOTP secrets. It needs Redis 7+ (no Cluster), persistence on, and `maxmemory-policy noeviction`, or users lose MFA.
{{- else}}

Schedule `DeleteExpired` on the session, code and attempt stores to clean up expired rows.
{{- end}}

